WEBVTT

00:01.835 --> 00:03.128
["Home Sick" by Benzamin playing]

00:16.141 --> 00:18.685
CLEANING DUTY
AHN SU-HO, YEON SI-EUN, OH BEOM-SEOK

00:18.768 --> 00:21.312
[Su-ho] Ah! Our science teacher's
out of their mind.

00:23.064 --> 00:24.816
Did they put sleeping pills
in their voice?

00:24.899 --> 00:26.901
I was so dazed, I almost passed out.

00:27.777 --> 00:29.446
[Beom-seok chuckles]

00:29.988 --> 00:31.698
It was so boring, I thought even Si-eun

00:31.781 --> 00:34.242
could make the lesson
more interesting if he was teaching.

00:34.325 --> 00:37.370
Nuh-uh. Si-eun's not a talker.

00:37.454 --> 00:39.831
- [chuckles]
- [Su-ho laughs] I don't think so.

00:40.415 --> 00:43.293
Is there any subject
you don't sleep through?

00:43.376 --> 00:44.878
I mean, is there one you actually like?

00:46.379 --> 00:47.672
[Su-ho] What do you know?

00:47.756 --> 00:50.759
You're always looking straight ahead,
pen in hand.

00:50.842 --> 00:52.302
- Forget it.
- [Su-ho] Hmm.

00:53.011 --> 00:54.929
I'm hungry. Let's get somethin' to eat.

00:55.013 --> 00:56.639
I have to get to my job.

00:56.723 --> 00:58.975
Yeong-i took the day off.
See you tomorrow.

01:00.602 --> 01:02.020
[Beom-seok] Si-eun, I, um…

01:02.103 --> 01:03.813
I have something going on at home today.

01:03.897 --> 01:06.149
We can all eat together tomorrow.

01:06.232 --> 01:07.233
I have to go.

01:07.317 --> 01:08.318
[chair scrapes]

01:10.070 --> 01:12.072
[footsteps receding]

01:28.129 --> 01:29.547
[music fades]

01:29.631 --> 01:31.633
[poignant music playing]

01:39.516 --> 01:41.351
[Aide Park] Do you understand
the situation?

01:42.560 --> 01:45.188
Yes. Please come as soon as possible.

01:47.524 --> 01:48.691
[phone bleeps]

01:50.318 --> 01:51.486
[sighs]

01:59.452 --> 02:02.664
Detectives are on their way.
Do you remember what I told you earlier?

02:03.665 --> 02:04.791
[Jeong-chan] Yes, sir.

02:06.876 --> 02:07.794
[Woo-yeong coughs]

02:09.754 --> 02:10.588
Yes.

02:13.174 --> 02:14.175
Tell me what I said.

02:16.136 --> 02:17.595
Uh, well…

02:19.055 --> 02:20.306
We were working out.

02:21.141 --> 02:24.102
He decided to take a break,
then suddenly collapsed.

02:26.187 --> 02:27.230
[Aide Park] And?

02:27.313 --> 02:28.940
[sirens approaching]

02:29.023 --> 02:31.901
[Tae-hun] To make sure
everyone keeps their mouths shut.

02:32.443 --> 02:35.530
If anything goes wrong,
we'll all get sent to juvie.

02:36.906 --> 02:38.408
[Aide Park] You deleted all videos?

02:39.534 --> 02:40.535
[Woo-yeong] Yes.

02:40.618 --> 02:42.453
[Aide Park] I'll check the CCTV footage.

02:42.537 --> 02:44.539
[sirens getting louder]

02:50.170 --> 02:52.172
[ringing tone]

02:56.217 --> 02:58.219
[ringing tone continues]

03:03.766 --> 03:05.768
[sounds echoing]

03:07.395 --> 03:09.397
[no audible dialogue]

03:10.064 --> 03:12.066
[poignant music continues]

03:27.081 --> 03:28.082
WHERE ARE YOU?

03:28.166 --> 03:30.835
I'M WORKING OUT. I'LL CALL YOU LATER

03:38.176 --> 03:39.552
[ringing tone continues]

03:54.025 --> 03:55.151
[music fades]

03:55.235 --> 03:56.778
[door slam echoes]

03:59.906 --> 04:01.908
["Hero" by Meego playing]

04:16.923 --> 04:22.053
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

05:18.568 --> 05:20.111
[Jin-won] You little shit.

05:20.903 --> 05:24.240
You're a fucking disgrace.
And you call yourself human? Huh?

05:25.116 --> 05:26.242
[sighs]

05:26.326 --> 05:27.910
[melancholy music playing]

05:27.994 --> 05:31.497
I'll hire a hit man to kill you
as soon as you get to the Philippines.

05:31.581 --> 05:32.832
You're disgusting.

05:34.334 --> 05:36.336
[breathing heavily]

05:41.674 --> 05:42.967
What about Su-ho?

05:44.344 --> 05:47.013
Can you actually believe
this little bastard?

05:49.223 --> 05:54.854
Hey, stay by his side 24-7
until he gets on his flight. Okay?

05:55.396 --> 05:57.231
- Yes, sir.
- You shit.

05:57.732 --> 05:59.317
Stupid son of a bitch.

06:01.778 --> 06:02.737
Fuck!

06:02.820 --> 06:04.280
[footsteps receding]

06:05.073 --> 06:06.366
- [door slams]
- [shudders]

06:08.159 --> 06:09.160
[sobs]

06:09.243 --> 06:10.119
[music fades]

06:10.203 --> 06:14.749
CLASS OF 2022, BYUKSAN HIGH SCHOOL
UNIVERSITY ADMISSIONS

06:14.832 --> 06:18.336
SEOUL NATIONAL UNIVERSITY: 3
YONSEI UNIVERSITY: 7

06:18.419 --> 06:21.839
SOGANG UNIVERSITY: 5
SUNGKYUNKWAN UNIVERSITY: 12

06:49.158 --> 06:50.743
[Yeong-i] We called the police.

06:51.244 --> 06:52.787
I'll keep looking for him too.

06:53.746 --> 06:56.416
You should go home for now.
Your finals are tomorrow.

07:07.760 --> 07:11.973
I'M WORKING OUT. I'LL CALL YOU LATER

07:16.102 --> 07:17.728
[teacher] Don't even think about cheating.

07:17.812 --> 07:20.606
Do your best according
to what you've prepared. All right?

07:20.690 --> 07:22.066
[all] Yes, sir.

07:44.255 --> 07:47.341
[boy 1] How would you feel if I said
I aced the test after you bombed it?

07:47.425 --> 07:49.927
- [boy 2] I slept through it.
- [boy 1] I'm pretty sure I did.

07:50.011 --> 07:52.763
- [boy 2] I'll do an online university.
- [boy 3] Hey, get your phones!

07:53.306 --> 07:55.099
- [boy 2] Never a dull moment.
- [boy 4] Phones!

07:56.017 --> 07:58.144
[boy 1] Actually, I studied pretty hard.

07:58.227 --> 08:01.355
So I'm pretty sure I did all right.
Might have missed a couple.

08:09.405 --> 08:15.995
YEONG-I
MISSED CALL

08:16.078 --> 08:17.205
[bleeps]

08:17.288 --> 08:18.581
[ringing tone]

08:21.959 --> 08:23.127
[sighs]

08:24.212 --> 08:26.631
- [Yeong-i, tearfully] Si-eun-a.
- Yeong-a.

08:27.548 --> 08:28.549
Did you call?

08:30.426 --> 08:32.261
[gasps] Si-eun, it's Su-ho.

08:32.345 --> 08:33.721
[sobbing]

08:34.680 --> 08:36.390
What'll happen to Su-ho?

08:38.893 --> 08:40.311
[sobbing]

08:42.021 --> 08:45.024
- ["Self" by Meego playing]
- ♪ Swear to God… ♪

08:45.107 --> 08:49.570
[Yeong-i] It was all because of
that asshole Oh Beom-seok and his gang.

08:49.654 --> 08:50.696
[sobbing]

08:50.780 --> 08:53.991
Some people dropped by
and offered to pay for his hospital bills.

08:54.659 --> 08:56.827
They got his grandmother
to sign something.

08:56.911 --> 08:58.746
[weeping]

09:00.081 --> 09:02.083
[song continues in Korean]

09:16.305 --> 09:17.515
Si-eun-a.

09:22.478 --> 09:24.146
Su-ho won't…

09:24.647 --> 09:26.482
[sobbing]

09:31.737 --> 09:33.864
Su-ho won't wake up.

09:33.948 --> 09:35.950
[continues crying]

09:45.293 --> 09:47.420
- [monitors bleeping]
- [ventilator hissing]

09:55.052 --> 09:56.804
[woman] Are you Su-ho's friend?

10:00.850 --> 10:01.892
Yes.

10:02.852 --> 10:03.853
[woman sighs]

10:05.938 --> 10:07.857
You must be Si-eun, right?

10:18.909 --> 10:20.369
[breathing shakily]

10:26.292 --> 10:27.627
[exhales]

10:28.794 --> 10:30.046
[breathing shakily]

10:35.009 --> 10:36.636
[crying]

10:39.513 --> 10:41.515
[sobbing]

11:04.455 --> 11:05.998
[music fades]

11:18.928 --> 11:20.137
Go to school.

11:22.056 --> 11:23.432
It's your finals week.

11:27.395 --> 11:30.022
I'll stay here, so you should go.

11:35.820 --> 11:36.904
Get some rest.

11:43.744 --> 11:44.829
[sighs]

12:02.304 --> 12:03.597
[door closes]

12:03.681 --> 12:05.683
[suspenseful music playing]

12:26.412 --> 12:27.830
[music fades]

12:31.041 --> 12:32.251
[Aide Park] Go wash up.

12:35.379 --> 12:37.757
The assemblyman
will stop by your school with you.

12:38.466 --> 12:40.426
You're to say goodbye to your teachers.

12:49.059 --> 12:51.061
[groans]

12:59.487 --> 13:00.613
Okay, but…

13:03.115 --> 13:04.283
what about Su-ho?

13:05.701 --> 13:07.453
[poignant music playing]

13:07.953 --> 13:09.121
Su-ho's still alive.

13:09.872 --> 13:11.874
[breathing shakily]

13:12.666 --> 13:14.543
If you want to keep him alive
at the hospital,

13:14.627 --> 13:16.670
you better do as the assemblyman says.

13:18.881 --> 13:20.090
[sighs]

13:22.051 --> 13:23.260
[sighs]

13:24.720 --> 13:26.222
[man on radio] According to the survey,

13:26.305 --> 13:29.767
48.7% of respondents
complained of lack of sleep.

13:29.850 --> 13:31.977
The primary causes of sleep deficiency

13:32.061 --> 13:34.438
included extensive hours
of studying at cram schools,

13:34.522 --> 13:37.733
private tutorials,
homework assignments, and online lectures.

13:37.817 --> 13:41.237
JISEONG HIGH SCHOOL

13:42.488 --> 13:44.240
[mysterious music playing]

13:53.541 --> 13:55.543
[siren blaring in distance]

14:03.968 --> 14:05.719
- Yeah, I know, but--
- [boy 2] Yeah, right?

14:08.097 --> 14:09.807
Which class is Jeon Yeong-bin in?

14:12.351 --> 14:13.644
[music fades]

14:16.272 --> 14:17.523
[Yeong-bin] What's up?

14:30.077 --> 14:30.911
What?

14:31.662 --> 14:33.414
[suspenseful music playing]

14:34.456 --> 14:35.749
[gasping and screaming]

14:35.833 --> 14:37.293
[Yeong-bin yelps]

14:40.045 --> 14:41.171
[groans]

14:42.047 --> 14:43.507
[students scream]

14:43.591 --> 14:45.301
[Yeong-bin wheezing]

14:48.596 --> 14:49.722
[gasps]

14:49.805 --> 14:51.223
Where's that bastard?

14:54.643 --> 14:56.604
- Who?
- [sighs]

15:03.903 --> 15:05.070
- [all gasp]
- [screams]

15:05.154 --> 15:07.948
[groaning]

15:08.032 --> 15:09.158
[whimpers]

15:10.326 --> 15:11.452
[pen clatters]

15:13.245 --> 15:14.580
The damn athlete.

15:15.706 --> 15:17.541
- Your friend.
- [Yeong-bin] In the gym.

15:18.709 --> 15:19.919
He's probably there.

15:20.920 --> 15:22.963
- It was him, right?
- [Yeong-bin shudders]

15:23.797 --> 15:24.798
What was?

15:26.800 --> 15:27.927
Tell me the truth.

15:28.552 --> 15:30.638
I wasn't there yesterday, I promise.

15:32.264 --> 15:33.933
I only saw a video the guys sent.

15:35.935 --> 15:37.061
What video?

15:40.606 --> 15:42.399
I said, "What video?"

15:43.275 --> 15:44.944
[Yeong-bin breathing unsteadily]

15:45.945 --> 15:47.821
This has nothing to do with me.

15:48.989 --> 15:49.990
Oh Beom-seok.

15:50.699 --> 15:53.452
Oh Beom-seok did
all this shit by himself. Look.

15:56.246 --> 15:57.414
[inhales]

15:58.874 --> 16:00.000
[grunts]

16:01.752 --> 16:03.045
It doesn't matter.

16:15.557 --> 16:16.558
[Beom-seok on video] Hey.

16:16.642 --> 16:20.562
[breathing shakily] Stop saying
my fucking name, you cocky shit.

16:20.646 --> 16:22.731
[blows landing]

16:22.815 --> 16:25.025
[Beom-seok] Bitch. You son of a bitch.

16:25.109 --> 16:26.860
- [grunts] Damn it.
- [blows continue]

16:31.782 --> 16:33.909
- [tires screech]
- [Jin-won] Damn it!

16:36.829 --> 16:37.830
Who's that?

16:42.835 --> 16:44.753
Did you put Su-ho into a coma?

16:45.713 --> 16:46.880
[gasps]

16:47.965 --> 16:50.801
It was you, you fucking dick!
Get out of the car!

16:50.884 --> 16:52.636
Get out, you fucking asshole!

16:52.720 --> 16:55.597
Who the fuck do you think you are,
ruining their lives? Huh?

16:55.681 --> 16:57.933
What did Su-ho ever do to you,
you piece of shit?

16:58.017 --> 17:00.102
Come on out, coward!
Don't you even feel bad?

17:00.185 --> 17:01.937
You're a little shithead loser, aren't ya?

17:02.021 --> 17:03.230
[Yeong-i] You fucking bastard!

17:03.313 --> 17:05.816
Get out of the car,
you fucking trash! Come out!

17:05.899 --> 17:07.568
Come face me, you asshole!

17:07.651 --> 17:09.069
[shudders]

17:09.153 --> 17:10.696
[Yeong-i] You fucking coward!

17:11.947 --> 17:13.198
[gasping]

17:17.369 --> 17:20.748
Our group turned to shit after you joined.
It's all your fault.

17:21.248 --> 17:22.291
[sighs]

17:23.625 --> 17:26.253
We got along freaking great
before you showed up.

17:27.588 --> 17:29.006
- [car door opens]
- [Jin-won] Hey!

17:30.424 --> 17:31.717
Get in the car!

17:32.718 --> 17:34.386
- [Aide Park] Let's go.
- [scoffs]

17:34.470 --> 17:36.221
- Don't tell me what to do.
- Handle this.

17:38.849 --> 17:40.184
[car door opens]

17:42.227 --> 17:43.562
- [sighs]
- [car door closes]

17:43.645 --> 17:45.647
[tense music playing]

17:54.656 --> 17:55.657
[sighs]

17:57.242 --> 17:58.368
[punches landing]

17:58.452 --> 18:00.746
JISEONG HIGH SCHOOL
WEIGHT ROOM

18:05.250 --> 18:07.419
[punching continues]

18:26.897 --> 18:28.273
[Si-eun grunts]

18:28.357 --> 18:30.025
[stick clatters]

18:33.779 --> 18:34.905
- [panting]
- [Woo-yeong] Hey.

18:34.988 --> 18:36.406
I can see right through you.

18:39.660 --> 18:41.662
Use your arms
to protect your chin at all times.

18:41.745 --> 18:42.746
Don't forget.

18:43.705 --> 18:44.790
Chin.

18:48.085 --> 18:49.419
[scoffs] What do you want?

18:50.003 --> 18:51.255
You wanna spar with me?

18:52.089 --> 18:54.341
[Su-ho] Next, imagine
there's a punk in front of you.

18:54.424 --> 18:57.302
When this happens,
you don't want to look into his eyes.

18:57.386 --> 18:58.554
Look at his shoulders instead.

19:01.014 --> 19:02.975
Then, when his shoulder comes
toward your face…

19:05.185 --> 19:07.146
[fast, dramatic music playing]

19:08.147 --> 19:09.273
[Woo-yeong] What the fuck?

19:10.399 --> 19:11.733
Come on.

19:12.985 --> 19:16.113
I just told you.
I can see right through you. Get it?

19:21.285 --> 19:25.581
You think… you stand a chance…
against me… you fucking asshole?

19:27.916 --> 19:28.917
- [grunts]
- [gasps]

19:29.001 --> 19:30.460
- [music fades]
- [high-pitched ringing]

19:30.544 --> 19:33.213
[Su-ho] The next step is
to take your fists and beat…

19:34.047 --> 19:35.048
Run.

19:36.425 --> 19:37.801
It's better just to run…

19:39.970 --> 19:41.889
because you might get hurt fighting him.

19:43.557 --> 19:45.517
[gasps] I don't wanna run.

19:48.979 --> 19:50.355
[chuckles] What?

19:52.774 --> 19:54.193
[Si-eun grunting]

19:55.569 --> 19:56.820
[dramatic music resumes]

20:04.870 --> 20:06.872
[Woo-yeong grunting]

20:09.166 --> 20:10.584
[shoelace creaking]

20:17.883 --> 20:19.176
[yells]

20:21.511 --> 20:23.013
Asshole!

20:27.726 --> 20:29.019
[groans]

20:29.519 --> 20:30.646
[screams]

20:31.813 --> 20:33.398
[music fades]

20:33.482 --> 20:35.150
[screams]

20:38.445 --> 20:39.905
[groans]

20:43.242 --> 20:44.952
Wait. Wait.

20:45.994 --> 20:47.371
Ahn Su-ho

20:48.038 --> 20:51.083
was hurt that bad 'cause Oh Beom-seok
kicked his head so many times.

20:51.667 --> 20:54.086
I have nothing to do with this. Fuck!

20:54.169 --> 20:56.338
- [whimpering]
- Oh yeah?

20:57.214 --> 20:58.632
- Okay.
- Listen to me, dude!

20:58.715 --> 21:00.759
I only sparred Ahn Su-ho in a match!

21:01.426 --> 21:03.595
Hey, please stop this. Yeah? All right?

21:03.679 --> 21:05.806
I apologize, okay? Huh?

21:06.974 --> 21:08.558
[gasping]

21:08.642 --> 21:10.269
Don't apologize to me.

21:13.563 --> 21:14.731
[crunching]

21:14.815 --> 21:17.150
[screams]

21:18.235 --> 21:19.236
[groans]

21:20.529 --> 21:21.613
[moans]

21:23.115 --> 21:24.616
- [groans]
- [Si-eun sighs]

21:26.410 --> 21:31.415
SCHOOL WHERE THE STUDENTS
AND THE TEACHERS ARE HAPPY

21:32.708 --> 21:34.918
[insects chirping]

21:58.775 --> 22:00.902
- Hello!
- Were you all waiting for me?

22:00.986 --> 22:02.612
Assemblyman, it's a pleasure.

22:02.696 --> 22:05.073
We appreciate you making the time
to pay us a visit.

22:05.157 --> 22:07.743
Oh, not at all.
This was long overdue. [chuckles]

22:07.826 --> 22:08.910
Life gets in the way.

22:08.994 --> 22:10.746
- [teacher] This is our faculty.
- [Ji-won] Yes.

22:10.829 --> 22:12.039
[Ji-won] I heard,

22:13.290 --> 22:17.085
about two days ago,
a student here was seriously injured.

22:18.545 --> 22:19.796
Well, yes.

22:20.922 --> 22:24.676
He was working out at the gym
with his friends the other night,

22:25.260 --> 22:27.346
when he collapsed, suddenly,

22:27.846 --> 22:29.473
while taking a little break.

22:32.225 --> 22:33.810
It was an accident.

22:34.311 --> 22:35.604
Oh, that's awful.

22:36.188 --> 22:37.314
[teacher] Yes.

22:37.397 --> 22:38.398
[Ji-won sighs]

22:39.441 --> 22:41.443
[papers rustling]

22:47.282 --> 22:49.368
[teacher pacing slowly]

22:58.168 --> 22:59.961
[birdsong]

23:02.339 --> 23:04.341
[dramatic, suspenseful music playing]

23:47.717 --> 23:49.010
[Si-eun sighs]

23:51.596 --> 23:52.848
Did something happen?

23:54.683 --> 23:55.892
Is that blood?

23:55.976 --> 23:57.686
[students murmuring]

23:59.771 --> 24:00.856
[teacher] Si-eun-a.

24:01.481 --> 24:03.316
Why is there blood on your uniform?

24:03.817 --> 24:05.444
What the fuck, man?

24:06.319 --> 24:07.863
- [boy 1] Oh!
- [Tae-hun] Shit!

24:07.946 --> 24:09.239
Oh fuck!

24:10.824 --> 24:12.200
Fuck, man. Hey.

24:12.826 --> 24:15.245
Please. Hey, calm down, okay?

24:15.328 --> 24:17.122
- Oh fuck.
- [Tae-hun] Let's talk it out! Fuck!

24:17.205 --> 24:18.748
Let's just talk it out! Come on!

24:18.832 --> 24:20.167
[fire extinguisher clangs]

24:21.251 --> 24:22.961
[Tae-hun] Oh my God, he's fucking crazy.

24:23.587 --> 24:25.505
- [boy 1] Oh shit.
- [Jeong-chan] Oh, no.

24:29.885 --> 24:30.802
Don't come near me.

24:31.761 --> 24:32.596
Stay away!

24:33.430 --> 24:34.389
Go away!

24:35.056 --> 24:35.974
Fuck you, man!

24:47.819 --> 24:49.279
[students gasp]

24:49.779 --> 24:51.031
[Tae-hun] Fuck you, shithead.

24:55.577 --> 24:56.578
[students gasp]

24:57.162 --> 24:58.163
[Tae-hun coughing]

25:01.416 --> 25:02.501
[groans]

25:04.503 --> 25:05.754
[students gasp]

25:08.715 --> 25:10.425
[breathing unsteadily]

25:10.509 --> 25:12.052
[students murmuring]

25:12.135 --> 25:13.637
[music fades]

25:31.780 --> 25:32.781
[sighs]

25:40.830 --> 25:42.165
I asked you…

25:45.335 --> 25:46.336
to stop.

25:47.712 --> 25:48.838
Just do it.

25:54.052 --> 25:55.345
We were all close.

26:00.016 --> 26:01.226
Hit me already.

26:05.897 --> 26:07.357
[students gasp]

26:08.400 --> 26:09.526
[all murmuring]

26:17.534 --> 26:18.785
Fuck you.

26:20.203 --> 26:21.204
Why?

26:22.622 --> 26:23.832
Why'd you do it?

26:25.166 --> 26:26.501
[breathing shakily]

26:28.962 --> 26:31.047
I have no idea why I did it.

26:34.301 --> 26:35.343
["Again" by Han playing]

26:35.427 --> 26:39.180
♪ I miss the memories, I miss your tune… ♪

26:41.349 --> 26:44.227
You should understand me, Si-eun-a.

26:44.311 --> 26:48.189
♪ I miss the compliments
The smile on your face… ♪

26:49.190 --> 26:50.150
Yeah.

26:51.234 --> 26:52.235
I do.

26:52.319 --> 26:54.904
♪ It was only just yesterday… ♪

26:54.988 --> 26:56.156
So I need…

26:58.575 --> 27:00.327
you to understand me, too.

27:01.286 --> 27:05.790
♪ It's summer already
Still I don't know what to do ♪

27:18.595 --> 27:20.597
[sobbing]

27:22.974 --> 27:24.976
[clattering]

27:30.607 --> 27:32.692
[murmuring]

27:32.776 --> 27:38.698
♪ How deep are you?
No tracks to follow you… ♪

27:41.534 --> 27:46.539
- What is everyone doing out in the hall?
- ♪ How real am I to face you hollow? ♪

27:46.623 --> 27:47.624
[teacher 1] Who is that?

27:47.707 --> 27:50.126
- Where's he going? Stop him.
- [teacher 2] It looks like Si-eun.

27:50.210 --> 27:51.795
- Yeon Si-eun.
- [teacher 3] Hey, Si-eun!

27:51.878 --> 27:54.005
- [teacher 4] Go back inside.
- [teacher 2] Si-eun-a!

27:54.089 --> 27:55.173
[teacher 3] Hey.

27:55.757 --> 27:57.926
- [teacher 2] Yeon Si-eun.
- [teacher 3] Yeon Si-eun.

27:59.052 --> 28:00.178
Yeon Si-eun!

28:00.845 --> 28:02.514
- Hey!
- [students gasping]

28:03.264 --> 28:05.308
What do you fucking want?

28:08.728 --> 28:13.775
♪ I feel my faith, my heart is racin' ♪

28:17.654 --> 28:22.409
♪ I wanna dive into your warmth ♪

28:24.994 --> 28:28.248
♪ Even if I do ♪

28:29.374 --> 28:34.003
♪ Even if I trust you ♪

28:34.754 --> 28:37.215
♪ Do you feel nothin'? ♪

28:53.940 --> 28:58.194
♪I finally do make up my mind… ♪

28:59.904 --> 29:02.282
- [monitors bleeping]
- [ventilator hissing]

29:02.782 --> 29:06.494
♪ It's time I lose you for good ♪

29:14.544 --> 29:16.004
[music fades]

29:16.087 --> 29:17.255
[Si-eun sighs]

29:28.433 --> 29:29.642
[sighs]

29:36.483 --> 29:37.817
[sighs]

29:47.118 --> 29:48.953
[sounds fade]

30:01.007 --> 30:03.843
[Su-ho] Si-eun-a, how can you sleep?

30:20.193 --> 30:21.277
[chuckles]

30:23.112 --> 30:24.030
'Cause…

30:26.032 --> 30:27.116
I'm tired.

30:28.701 --> 30:29.953
[chuckles]

30:32.497 --> 30:33.915
You really are

30:35.542 --> 30:37.168
a psycho, you know that?

30:37.919 --> 30:38.920
Yeah?

30:43.633 --> 30:44.717
I'm sorry.

30:46.761 --> 30:47.637
For what?

30:51.724 --> 30:52.684
Everything.

31:00.275 --> 31:01.192
Me too.

31:06.239 --> 31:07.198
Sorry.

31:11.369 --> 31:13.246
["Home Sick" by Benzamin playing]

31:24.048 --> 31:26.301
- [monitors bleeping]
- [ventilator hissing]

31:44.485 --> 31:45.486
[sniffles]

31:55.955 --> 31:57.957
[sobbing]

32:10.762 --> 32:12.305
[sobbing continues]

32:25.151 --> 32:27.153
["Home Sick" continues]

33:09.112 --> 33:10.196
[Si-eun] Beom-seok…

33:17.370 --> 33:18.871
left to study abroad.

33:19.372 --> 33:21.124
[woman] It was in Paris! Come on.

33:21.207 --> 33:22.750
[indistinct chatter]

33:24.877 --> 33:26.879
["Home Sick" continues]

33:30.842 --> 33:33.136
[Si-eun] Yeong-i said
everything was her fault.

33:34.220 --> 33:36.347
She apologized and then disappeared.

33:38.349 --> 33:41.477
I hear she gives Su-ho's grandmother
a call from time to time,

33:42.562 --> 33:44.397
but I can never reach her.

33:48.985 --> 33:52.238
Beom-seok's father tried
to send me to a juvie center.

33:53.281 --> 33:55.324
But I was only forced to transfer schools

33:55.408 --> 33:59.370
because I agreed to keep quiet
about what happened to Su-ho.

34:01.414 --> 34:03.499
However, he had already made sure

34:03.583 --> 34:05.877
all the schools in Seoul rejected me.

34:06.586 --> 34:10.048
Only Eunjang High School in Yeongdeungpo
was willing to accept me.

34:16.095 --> 34:18.723
EUNJANG HIGH SCHOOL

34:22.477 --> 34:23.936
[music fades]

34:36.532 --> 34:37.742
Si-eun-a.

34:40.661 --> 34:41.954
I'll go with you.

34:42.455 --> 34:44.957
I should introduce myself
to your homeroom teacher.

34:46.584 --> 34:48.920
It's okay. I'll go alone.

34:56.344 --> 34:57.470
[father] You did well.

35:05.144 --> 35:06.938
You did absolutely nothing wrong.

35:17.657 --> 35:19.700
- Hey, stupid!
- Come on! He's wussin' out!

35:19.784 --> 35:21.160
- Hey, hey! Hey!
- Punk ass!

35:21.244 --> 35:23.287
You gotta punch! You gotta punch!

35:23.371 --> 35:25.414
- Like that, all right?
- Aim for the midsection!

35:25.498 --> 35:26.833
All right. Go on!

35:30.002 --> 35:30.878
Man.

35:31.504 --> 35:32.380
[boy 1] Come on!

35:32.463 --> 35:33.631
- Okay, come on.
- [boy 2 groans]

35:33.714 --> 35:34.674
- Nice one!
- You got that?

35:34.757 --> 35:37.093
Everyone, back in your seats. Come on.

35:37.176 --> 35:39.053
- [boy 3] Like that, man!
- [teacher] Sit down!

35:39.137 --> 35:40.429
[students murmuring]

35:40.513 --> 35:42.849
Hey! I have arrived.

35:42.932 --> 35:44.559
[silence]

35:47.061 --> 35:48.271
[clears throat]

35:49.147 --> 35:50.731
We have a transfer student.

35:52.191 --> 35:53.651
Introduce yourself.

35:56.362 --> 35:57.530
I'm Yeon Si-eun.

35:58.364 --> 35:59.490
Nice to meet you.

36:00.199 --> 36:02.076
- [giggling]
- [boy 4] Look at his face.

36:03.661 --> 36:05.788
[teacher] Si-eun-a,
you can sit over there.

36:07.707 --> 36:09.709
[indistinct chatter]

36:24.348 --> 36:25.349
[boy 5] Hi.

36:27.852 --> 36:29.103
[boy 1] How many?

36:29.187 --> 36:31.272
I'm not… Wow! Okay. All right. I think I…

36:31.772 --> 36:32.940
[clang]

36:39.947 --> 36:42.617
Yeon Si-eun. That's pretty.

36:43.409 --> 36:45.328
What are you, a girl?

36:45.411 --> 36:46.495
[laughs]

36:50.875 --> 36:52.668
Hey, bro, what's up with your eyes?

36:52.752 --> 36:56.047
Your stare makes me feel like shit.
What a fucking asshole.

36:56.130 --> 36:57.840
It's getting a little chilly in here.

36:57.924 --> 36:59.425
- [laughter]
- [boy 2] Huh?

36:59.967 --> 37:00.885
[boy 1] Ooh!

37:02.720 --> 37:03.930
[boy 5 sighs]

37:04.013 --> 37:06.015
[unsettling music playing]

37:06.599 --> 37:08.434
You're mine now, bitch.

37:10.978 --> 37:11.812
You all…

37:13.773 --> 37:15.566
are disappointingly predictable.

37:17.485 --> 37:18.319
What?

37:22.448 --> 37:23.532
Do you think…

37:25.701 --> 37:27.328
this makes you look cool?

37:28.537 --> 37:30.915
What the hell's
this son of a bitch saying? [scoffs]

37:31.415 --> 37:33.501
Shut it, or I'll smash your fucking teeth.

37:37.713 --> 37:39.465
[creaking]

37:45.805 --> 37:47.807
[music intensifying]

37:52.019 --> 37:53.396
[music fades]

37:54.063 --> 37:56.482
["Brass Knuckle" by Boi B playing]

38:05.908 --> 38:06.993
[music stops]

38:09.996 --> 38:12.415
[man] This prick just transferred
to Eunjang High.

38:12.915 --> 38:15.418
He beat up Kang Woo-yeong,
the alliance candidate.

38:19.630 --> 38:20.923
What should I do?

38:28.014 --> 38:29.307
["Home Sick" by Benzamin playing]

38:29.390 --> 38:31.392
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

38:31.475 --> 38:33.477
[lyrics in Korean]

38:42.737 --> 38:46.157
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

38:46.240 --> 38:48.242
[lyrics in Korean]

39:13.184 --> 39:14.143
♪ Pouring… ♪

39:14.226 --> 39:15.770
[lyrics in Korean]

39:18.773 --> 39:20.524
♪ Puffing, I'll figure it out… ♪

39:20.608 --> 39:22.234
[lyrics in Korean]

39:23.027 --> 39:24.403
♪ I know that…

39:24.487 --> 39:26.489
[lyrics in Korean]

39:27.073 --> 39:30.493
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

39:30.576 --> 39:32.578
[lyrics in Korean]

39:41.796 --> 39:45.216
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

39:45.299 --> 39:47.301
[lyrics in Korean]

39:57.937 --> 39:59.605
♪ I don't know how to go home again… ♪

39:59.688 --> 40:01.690
[lyrics in Korean]

40:08.823 --> 40:11.450
♪ The window shows another conscience
You can't find me…♪

40:11.534 --> 40:13.536
[lyrics in Korean]

40:14.787 --> 40:16.622
♪ I sing along with my rival… ♪

40:16.705 --> 40:18.707
[lyrics in Korean]

40:26.090 --> 40:29.510
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

40:29.593 --> 40:31.595
[lyrics in Korean]

40:40.938 --> 40:44.358
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

40:44.442 --> 40:46.444
[lyrics in Korean]

40:57.037 --> 40:58.622
♪ No one's beside me… ♪

40:58.706 --> 41:00.708
[lyrics in Korean]

41:15.431 --> 41:18.726
♪ Boy, I get so wild
For my love of probs, yeah… ♪

41:18.809 --> 41:20.811
[lyrics in Korean]

41:26.066 --> 41:27.359
♪ The door shine again… ♪

41:27.443 --> 41:29.445
[lyrics in Korean]

41:40.664 --> 41:41.957
♪ The door shine again… ♪

41:42.041 --> 41:44.043
[lyrics in Korean]

41:54.762 --> 41:58.182
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

41:58.265 --> 42:00.267
[lyrics in Korean]

42:09.527 --> 42:12.071
♪ Baby, I don't know how to go home
Now I'm sick… ♪

42:12.154 --> 42:15.157
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS
ARE FICTIONAL

42:15.241 --> 42:17.743
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

